# Vendored snapshots are byte-exact and must round-trip unchanged.
#
# reference/respkit_snapshot/ carries a sha256 content fingerprint in its
# PROVENANCE.txt, recomputed with:
#
#     find R inst tests DESCRIPTION NAMESPACE -type f | sort \
#       | xargs sha256sum | sha256sum
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without -text git would rewrite
# LF to CRLF on checkout and that fingerprint would not reproduce on a fresh
# clone. A pre-registration that pins a library version needs the pin to hold.
reference/respkit_snapshot/** -text
